### Get issues with pagination
GET http://localhost:8080/api/issues?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Get issues sorted by title
GET http://localhost:8080/api/issues?sort=title,asc
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Get issues with combined filters
GET http://localhost:8080/api/issues?projectId=1&status=IN_PROGRESS&priority=MEDIUM&search=navigation
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Get issues for a project
GET http://localhost:8080/api/projects/1/issues
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Get an issue by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/issues/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Create an issue
POST http://localhost:8080/api/projects/1/issues
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Fix mobile navigation",
  "description": "The navigation menu does not close after selecting a link on small screens.",
  "priority": "HIGH"
}

### Update an issue
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/issues/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Fix mobile navigation menu",
  "description": "Ensure the navigation menu closes after selecting a link on small screens.",
  "priority": "MEDIUM"
}

### Change an issue status
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/issues/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}

### Assign issue
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/issues/1/assignee
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assigneeId": 1
}

### Unassign issue
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/issues/1/assignee
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Delete an issue
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/issues/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
